                                "sense_id": "3d7923f9-b8e0-3e0a-b690-9714acd4b49b",
                                "text": "Eyes asquint, he saw she was driving much too fast."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "029c8f55-91a5-48c2-a633-431c994fa756",
                                "sense_id": "3d7923f9-b8e0-3e0a-b690-9714acd4b49b",
                                "text": "Faces never lie, it is said. […] When a man speaks the truth in the spirit of truth, his eye is as clear as the heavens. When he has base ends, and speaks falsely, the eye is muddy and sometimes asquint."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
